{"id":"75ba006af50075ad","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-nexp.md","title":"Nondeterministic Exponential Time","display":"df-nexp — Nondeterministic Exponential Time","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-ntime]]"],"display":"df-nexp — Nondeterministic Exponential Time","label":"28-df-nexp","aliases":["28-df-nexp"],"type":"definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7514d356710d2e51\" href=\"?note=7514d356710d2e51\" title=\"28-df-ntime\">28-df-ntime</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-nexp — Nondeterministic Exponential Time"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-nexp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-nexp</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NTIME}(t)\">\\(\\mathrm{NTIME}(t)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7514d356710d2e51\" href=\"?note=7514d356710d2e51\" title=\"28-df-ntime\">28-df-ntime</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NEXP}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathrm{NTIME}(n\\mapsto2^{(n+2)^a}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{NEXP}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathrm{NTIME}(n\\mapsto2^{(n+2)^a}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{\\mathrm{poly}(n)}\">\\(2^{\\mathrm{poly}(n)}\\)</span> 时间的并类；有限短输入及多项式中的常数可由指数次数和机器常数吸收。</p>\n<p>来源核对：§2.6.2；印刷56页；PDF82页。陈述已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-ntime","status":"resolved","id":"7514d356710d2e51","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ntime]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ntime","status":"resolved","id":"7514d356710d2e51","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NTIME}(t)$ 见 [[28-df-ntime]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{NTIME}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NEXP}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathrm{NTIME}(n\\mapsto2^{(n+2)^a}).","display":true},{"tex":"2^{\\mathrm{poly}(n)}","display":false}],"bytes":694,"backlinks":[{"id":"5c3d3fd9c681563f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"基本复杂性类：[[28-df-p]]、[[28-df-np]]、[[28-df-conp]]、[[28-df-l]]、[[28-df-nl]]、[[28-df-pspace]]、[[28-df-npspace]]、[[28-df-exp]]、[[28-df-nexp]]。"},{"id":"c7beb78bfca18f0d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8ce4101309cb3ce8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c9ef13719785316e","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ZEROP}_{\\mathbb Z}$、$\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb Z,k}$、$\\operatorname{poly}$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-identity-testing]]；$\\operatorname{asize}$ 见 [[28-df-arithmetic-circuit]]。$\\mathbf P,\\mathbf{NEXP},\\mathbf{P/poly}$ 采用 [[28-df-p]]、[[28-df-nexp]]、[[28-df-p-poly]]。$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；$S_n$ 为 $[n]$ 上所有排列；$X_1,\\ldots,X_{n^2}$ 为算术电路的形式变量，矩阵变量 $X_{ij}$ 由下式按行编号。"}],"outgoing":["7514d356710d2e51"]}